<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Wohnungen importieren</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/contao/css/main.min.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background: #f0f0f0;
        }
        
        .import-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        .import-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .import-header {
            border-bottom: 3px solid #f47c00;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .import-header h2 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #333;
            font-size: 28px;
        }
        
        .import-instructions {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        
        .import-instructions h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #007bff;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        
        .column-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        
        .column-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 10px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        
        .column-letter {
            background: #007bff;
            color: white;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 12px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .column-name {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #333;
        }
        
        .upload-area {
            border: 2px dashed #ccc;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            background: #fafafa;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .upload-area:hover {
            border-color: #007bff;
            background: #f0f7ff;
        }
        
        .upload-icon {
            font-size: 48px;
            color: #007bff;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .file-input-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .file-input-wrapper input[type="file"] {
            font-size: 16px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
        }
        
        .btn-primary {
            background: #007bff;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #0056b3;
        }
        
        .hint-box {
            background: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffc107;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: start;
        }
        
        .hint-icon {
            color: #ffc107;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-right: 12px;
        }
        
        .preview-section {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #28a745;
        }
        
        .preview-section.update {
            border-left-color: #ffc107;
        }
        
        .preview-section.skip {
            border-left-color: #dc3545;
        }
        
        .preview-section h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .preview-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .preview-table th,
        .preview-table td {
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        
        .preview-table th {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #495057;
        }
        
        .preview-table tr:hover {
            background: #f8f9fa;
        }
        
        .change-item {
            margin: 15px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        
        .change-header {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #333;
        }
        
        .change-old {
            color: #dc3545;
            text-decoration: line-through;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            background: #f8d7da;
            border-radius: 3px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .change-new {
            color: #28a745;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            background: #d4edda;
            border-radius: 3px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .status-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .status-new {
            background: #d4edda;
            color: #155724;
        }
        
        .status-update {
            background: #fff3cd;
            color: #856404;
        }
        
        .status-skip {
            background: #f8d7da;
            color: #721c24;
        }
        
        .confirm-buttons {
            margin-top: 30px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .btn-success {
            background: #28a745;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        
        .btn-success:hover {
            background: #218838;
        }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            background: #6c757d;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: #5a6268;
        }
        
        .summary-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .stat-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        
        .stat-number {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        
        .stat-label {
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .stat-card.new .stat-number {
            color: #28a745;
        }
        
        .stat-card.update .stat-number {
            color: #ffc107;
        }
        
        .stat-card.skip .stat-number {
            color: #dc3545;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="__ua__ __os__">

<div class="import-container">
    <div class="import-card">
        <div class="import-header">
            <a href="<?= $this->href ?>" class="header_back" style="float: right; margin-top: 5px;">← <?= $this->title ?></a>
            <h2>📥 Wohnungen importieren</h2>
        </div>

        <?php if ($this->messages): ?>
            <?= $this->messages ?>
        <?php endif; ?>

        <?php if ($this->preview): ?>
            <!-- Vorschau anzeigen -->
            <h3>📊 Import-Vorschau</h3>
            
            <div class="summary-stats">
                <div class="stat-card new">
                    <div class="stat-label">Neue Wohnungen</div>
                    <div class="stat-number"><?= count($this->preview['new']) ?></div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card update">
                    <div class="stat-label">Aktualisierungen</div>
                    <div class="stat-number"><?= count($this->preview['update']) ?></div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card skip">
                    <div class="stat-label">Übersprungen</div>
                    <div class="stat-number"><?= count($this->preview['skip']) ?></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <?php if (!empty($this->preview['new'])): ?>
                <div class="preview-section">
                    <h3><span class="status-badge status-new">✓ Neue Wohnungen (<?= count($this->preview['new']) ?>)</span></h3>
                    <table class="preview-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Objektnr.</th>
                                <th>Bezeichnung</th>
                                <th>Bauetappe</th>
                                <th>Zeile</th>
                                <th>Adresse</th>
                                <th>Etage</th>
                                <th>Zimmer</th>
                                <th>Nettomiete</th>
                                <th>Status</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <?php foreach ($this->preview['new'] as $item): ?>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong><?= $item['objektnummer'] ?></strong></td>
                                    <td><?= $item['bezeichnung'] ?></td>
                                    <td><?= $item['bauetappe'] ?></td>
                                    <td><?= $item['zeile'] ?></td>
                                    <td><?= $item['adresse'] ?></td>
                                    <td><?= $item['etage'] ?></td>
                                    <td><?= $item['zimmer'] ?></td>
                                    <td><?= $item['nettomietzins'] ?></td>
                                    <td><?= $item['status'] ?></td>
                                </tr>
                            <?php endforeach; ?>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            <?php endif; ?>

            <?php if (!empty($this->preview['update'])): ?>
                <div class="preview-section update">
                    <h3><span class="status-badge status-update">↻ Zu aktualisierende Wohnungen (<?= count($this->preview['update']) ?>)</span></h3>
                    <?php foreach ($this->preview['update'] as $item): ?>
                        <div class="change-item">
                            <div class="change-header">📝 Objektnummer: <?= $item['objektnummer'] ?> (ID: <?= $item['id'] ?>)</div>
                            <?php if (!empty($item['changes'])): ?>
                                <table class="preview-table">
                                    <thead>
                                        <tr>
                                            <th style="width: 150px;">Feld</th>
                                            <th>Alt</th>
                                            <th>Neu</th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                        <?php foreach ($item['changes'] as $field => $change): ?>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td><strong><?= $field ?></strong></td>
                                                <td><span class="change-old"><?= $change['old'] ?: '(leer)' ?></span></td>
                                                <td><span class="change-new"><?= $change['new'] ?: '(leer)' ?></span></td>
                                            </tr>
                                        <?php endforeach; ?>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            <?php endif; ?>
                        </div>
                    <?php endforeach; ?>
                </div>
            <?php endif; ?>

            <?php if (!empty($this->preview['skip'])): ?>
                <div class="preview-section skip">
                    <h3><span class="status-badge status-skip">⊘ Übersprungene Zeilen (<?= count($this->preview['skip']) ?>)</span></h3>
                    <ul>
                        <?php foreach ($this->preview['skip'] as $item): ?>
                            <li><?= $item['reason'] ?></li>
                        <?php endforeach; ?>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            <?php endif; ?>

            <!-- Bestätigungs-Formular -->
            <form action="<?= $this->action ?>" method="post">
                <input type="hidden" name="FORM_SUBMIT" value="tl_apartments_import_confirm">
                <input type="hidden" name="REQUEST_TOKEN" value="<?= $this->requestToken ?>">
                <input type="hidden" name="temp_file" value="<?= $this->preview['tempFile'] ?>">
                
                <div class="confirm-buttons">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-success">
                        ✓ Import bestätigen und ausführen
                    </button>
                    <a href="<?= $this->action ?>" class="btn-secondary">
                        Abbrechen
                    </a>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>

        <?php else: ?>
            <!-- Upload-Formular -->
            <div class="import-instructions">
                <h3>📋 Excel-Datei Struktur</h3>
                <p>Ihre Excel-Datei muss folgende Spalten in dieser Reihenfolge enthalten:</p>
                
                <div class="column-list">
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">A</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Objektnummer *</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">B</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Bezeichnung</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">C</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Bauetappe</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">D</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Zeile</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">E</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Adresse</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">F</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Etage</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">G</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Zimmer</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">H</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Fläche</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">I</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Nettomiete</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">J</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Nebenkosten</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">K</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Bruttomiete</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column-item">
                        <div class="column-letter">L</div>
                        <div class="column-name">Status</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="hint-box">
                <div class="hint-icon">💡</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Hinweis:</strong> Die erste Zeile (Header) wird automatisch übersprungen. 
                    Bestehende Wohnungen mit gleicher Objektnummer werden aktualisiert.
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <form action="<?= $this->action ?>" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                <input type="hidden" name="FORM_SUBMIT" value="tl_apartments_import">
                <input type="hidden" name="REQUEST_TOKEN" value="<?= $this->requestToken ?>">
                
                <div class="upload-area">
                    <div class="upload-icon">📄</div>
                    <h3>Excel-Datei auswählen</h3>
                    <p style="color: #6c757d; margin: 10px 0;">Unterstützte Formate: .xlsx, .xls</p>
                    
                    <div class="file-input-wrapper">
                        <input type="file" name="import_file" id="import_file" accept=".xlsx,.xls" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">
                        🔍 Vorschau anzeigen
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        <?php endif; ?>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>